                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJRwWA2S2rQjQRiO7WShOX2Ms/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIanAza0VnEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The egg pancakes were quite greasy when cold, but the toast dishes had plenty of vegetables and were very good. The food was prepared with care, but the prices were a bit high. There were no tables for dine-in, but the online ordering system was super convenient! Worth trying!\n\nThe taro and pork floss egg pancake was very special, with a unique flavor, but it had a slightly rancid oil taste, which was a bit of a drawback. I hope they\u0027ll offer that flavor in the future.\n\nThe egg toast dishes had plenty of vegetables, and the vegetables were well-drained, so the toast wasn\u0027t soggy, making it a refreshing breakfast.\n\nThe half-sweet milk tea had a unique caramel flavor, while the black tea soy milk was just average to me.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "蛋餅類沒有現吃冷掉之後比較油膩，吐司類青菜很多很不錯，餐點口味用心，但價格偏高，沒有內用桌，有線上點餐系統超級方便！值得嘗試！\n\n芋泥肉鬆蛋餅很特別，口味很特殊，但是蛋餅有油耗味，所以有點美中不足，希望未來也有芋泥肉鬆蛋吐司這個口味。\n\n蛋吐司類的青菜很多，青菜的水分也有甩乾，所以吐司吃起來沒有濕濕的，早餐吃覺得很清爽。\n\n半糖奶茶口味很特別有焦糖味，紅茶豆漿我覺得很普通。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
